            <ArticleTitle>&quot;The 24th Conference&quot; of the Groupement des Pharmacochimistes de l'Arc Atlantique (GP2A).</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">E17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3390/ph10010017</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The GP2A European Conference is a two-day meeting focused on medicinal chemistry and the use of tools to explore all fields of drug discovery and drug design such as molecular modelling, bioorganic chemistry, MS studies, in vitro in vivo assays, and structure activity relationships. Abstracts of keynote lectures, plenary lectures, junior lectures, flash presentations, and posters presented during the meeting are collated in this report.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
